# Exported symbol list for the macOS game modules (-Wl,-exported_symbols_list).
#
# Darwin peer of tools/build/linux_game_module.map and of the game.def /
# mpgame.def module definition files used on Windows. macOS was the only host
# where a game module exported its whole symbol table: every idlib symbol, every
# weak inline and every vtable, all with default visibility.
#
# That matters because a game module carries its own copy of idlib and of the
# game types, and the single-player and multiplayer modules disagree about those
# types by construction (GAME_MPAPI selects mpgame/Game_local.h over
# game/Game_local.h). Two copies of the same symbol name with different
# definitions, both exported, is a loader-order lottery -- see issue #90.
#
# Only the module entry point may be exported.
#
# Leading underscore is the Mach-O C symbol decoration.
_GetGameAPI
